Option 1: Hide all built-in AI features (Recommended)

Open Settings and search for: chat.disableAIFeatures Enable it, 

or add this to settings.json:
{
    "chat.disableAIFeatures": true
}

Option 2: Remove Copilot Extensions

Open Extensions (Ctrl+Shift+X):

Uninstall GitHub Copilot
Uninstall GitHub Copilot Chat

This completely removes Copilot from VS Code.

Option 3: Disable AI Suggestions Only

Add to settings.json:
{
    "github.copilot.enable": {
        "*": false
    }
}